{"id":"f1751959740e455f","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-first-order-derivation.md","title":"Classical First-Order Theory Derivability","display":"df-first-order-derivation — Classical First-Order Theory Derivability","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-first-order-derivation","aliases":["92-df-first-order-derivation"],"display":"df-first-order-derivation — Classical First-Order Theory Derivability","source":"本地一般一阶演算；Smullyan 第 III 章 p. 29 采用另一等价 Hilbert 呈现","source_status":"原书之外的演算桥接","depends_on":["[[92-df-first-order-language]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-first-order-derivation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-first-order-derivation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-first-order-derivation — Classical First-Order Theory Derivability"},{"key":"source","html":"本地一般一阶演算；Smullyan 第 III 章 p. 29 采用另一等价 Hilbert 呈现"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书之外的演算桥接"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b230b875687723ed\" href=\"?note=b230b875687723ed\" title=\"92-df-first-order-language\">92-df-first-order-language</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOLang}_{92}(L)\">\\(\\mathrm{FOLang}_{92}(L)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>所有模式变元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,C\">\\(A,B,C\\)</span> 范围为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_L\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in V\">\\(x\\in V\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,u\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_L\">\\(t,u\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_L\\)</span>；代入采用<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b230b875687723ed\" href=\"?note=b230b875687723ed\" title=\"92-df-first-order-language\">92-df-first-order-language</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LogAx}_L,T\\vdash_L\\varphi,\\bot_L,\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta},L}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{LogAx}_L,T\\vdash_L\\varphi,\\bot_L,\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta},L}(T)\\)</span> 为定义目标。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LogAx}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{LogAx}_L\\)</span> 包含下列实例、全部命题重言式实例、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 等价式的双向蕴涵，以及下列定义等价式：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists x A\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\forall x\\neg A\">\\(\\exists x A\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\forall x\\neg A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\land B\\leftrightarrow\\neg(A\\to\\neg B)\">\\(A\\land B\\leftrightarrow\\neg(A\\to\\neg B)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\lor B\\leftrightarrow(\\neg A\\to B)\">\\(A\\lor B\\leftrightarrow(\\neg A\\to B)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leftrightarrow\">\\(\\leftrightarrow\\)</span> 表示两个方向的蕴涵都作为公理加入。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\nA\\to(B\\to A),\\qquad (A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)),\\\\\n(\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A),\\qquad\n\\forall x A\\to\\mathrm{Subst}_L(A,t,x),\\\\\n\\forall x(A\\to B)\\to(A\\to\\forall x B)\\quad(x\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_L(A)),\\\\\nt=t,\\qquad t=u\\to(\\mathrm{Subst}_L(A,t,x)\\to\\mathrm{Subst}_L(A,u,x)).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\nA\\to(B\\to A),\\qquad (A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)),\\\\\n(\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A),\\qquad\n\\forall x A\\to\\mathrm{Subst}_L(A,t,x),\\\\\n\\forall x(A\\to B)\\to(A\\to\\forall x B)\\quad(x\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_L(A)),\\\\\nt=t,\\qquad t=u\\to(\\mathrm{Subst}_L(A,t,x)\\to\\mathrm{Subst}_L(A,u,x)).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}derivation}\\vdash\nT\\vdash_L\\varphi\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\ge1\\;\\exists(A_0,\\ldots,A_{n-1})\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L^n\\;\n[A_{n-1}=\\varphi\\land\\forall i&lt;n\\;D_i],\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}derivation}\\vdash\nT\\vdash_L\\varphi\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\ge1\\;\\exists(A_0,\\ldots,A_{n-1})\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L^n\\;\n[A_{n-1}=\\varphi\\land\\forall i&lt;n\\;D_i],\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_i\">\\(D_i\\)</span> 是以下四项的析取：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in T\">\\(A_i\\in T\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathrm{LogAx}_L\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathrm{LogAx}_L\\)</span>；存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_k=(A_j\\to B)\">\\(A_k=(A_j\\to B)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=B\">\\(A_i=B\\)</span>；存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i,x\\in V\">\\(j&lt;i,x\\in V\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=\\forall x A_j\">\\(A_i=\\forall x A_j\\)</span>。构造实例中的替换采用确定的最小新变量策略；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 等价按绑定变量的对应关系判定，逻辑度不变。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bot_L\\coloneqq\\forall v_0\\neg(v_0=v_0),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta},L}(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg(T\\vdash_L\\bot_L).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bot_L\\coloneqq\\forall v_0\\neg(v_0=v_0),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta},L}(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg(T\\vdash_L\\bot_L).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是有限证明的元层可导性。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 只有句子，所以 Gen 不受开放假设的自由变量限制；若加入开放前提则必须改规则。标准 Hilbert 一阶等式演算证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\bot_L\">\\(\\neg\\bot_L\\)</span>，故此相容性等价于不存在可证的句子及其否定。\n这里的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash_L\\varphi\">\\(T\\vdash_L\\varphi\\)</span> 不等于算术三元组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\vdash\\varphi\">\\(G\\vdash\\varphi\\)</span>，也不是以模型满足直接定义的“可证”。两种演算的闭句对应须用明确的翻译及完备性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"b230b875687723ed","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"b230b875687723ed","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"所有模式变元 $A,B,C$ 范围为 $\\mathrm{Fml}_L$，$x\\in V$、$t,u\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_L$；代入采用[[92-df-first-order-language]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOLang}_{92}(L)","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L","display":false},{"tex":"A,B,C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_L","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"t,u\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LogAx}_L,T\\vdash_L\\varphi,\\bot_L,\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta},L}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LogAx}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists x A\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\forall x\\neg A","display":false},{"tex":"A\\land B\\leftrightarrow\\neg(A\\to\\neg B)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\lor B\\leftrightarrow(\\neg A\\to B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\leftrightarrow","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\nA\\to(B\\to A),\\qquad (A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)),\\\\\n(\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A),\\qquad\n\\forall x A\\to\\mathrm{Subst}_L(A,t,x),\\\\\n\\forall x(A\\to B)\\to(A\\to\\forall x B)\\quad(x\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_L(A)),\\\\\nt=t,\\qquad t=u\\to(\\mathrm{Subst}_L(A,t,x)\\to\\mathrm{Subst}_L(A,u,x)).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}derivation}\\vdash\nT\\vdash_L\\varphi\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\ge1\\;\\exists(A_0,\\ldots,A_{n-1})\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L^n\\;\n[A_{n-1}=\\varphi\\land\\forall i<n\\;D_i],","display":true},{"tex":"D_i","display":false},{"tex":"A_i\\in T","display":false},{"tex":"A_i\\in\\mathrm{LogAx}_L","display":false},{"tex":"j,k<i","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"A_k=(A_j\\to B)","display":false},{"tex":"A_i=B","display":false},{"tex":"j<i,x\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"A_i=\\forall x A_j","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot_L\\coloneqq\\forall v_0\\neg(v_0=v_0),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta},L}(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg(T\\vdash_L\\bot_L).","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\bot_L","display":false},{"tex":"T\\vdash_L\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"G\\vdash\\varphi","display":false}],"bytes":2651,"backlinks":[{"id":"cd8dcab3ce41cbc6","anchor":"ref-17","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"本次修复重点为：同语言系统族的 Con/Complete/Th 签名，开放 PA 公理的全称闭包，IΔ0 演算中的逻辑公理，一般语言的语法/语义/有限演算，以及集合论扩展的成员语言类型。固定点复杂度条目补给具体见证；Craig 与创造集条目补给可检查的构造步骤。[[92-df-universal-closure]]、[[92-df-first-order-language]]、[[92-df-language-indexed-semantics]]、[[92-df-first-order-derivation]]记录新增接口。"},{"id":"83eb2b67a65ec154","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"66c9470f107a6bad","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZF}_{92},\\mathrm{AC}_{92},\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}$ 是闭句公理集及选择公理的定义目标；$T\\vdash_\\in\\varphi$ 与 $\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta},\\in}(T)$ 采用[[92-df-first-order-derivation]]。"},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-139","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-first-order-language]] → [[92-df-language-indexed-semantics]] → [[92-df-first-order-derivation]]供语言扩张与成员语言使用。非标准模型见[[92-ex-nonstandard-model]]；集合论背景见[[92-df-zfc]]、[[92-df-continuum-hypothesis]]、[[92-df-constructible-universe]]、[[92-df-forcing]]与[[92-thm-ch-independence]]。这些背景不冒充原书的算术语法或定理证明。"},{"id":"fef4cc51fd3a44b5","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T\\vdash_\\in\\varphi$ 及 $\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta},\\in}(T)\\equiv\\neg(T\\vdash_\\in\\bot_\\in)$ 见[[92-df-first-order-derivation]]。"},{"id":"bf5133176eaa12c8","anchor":"ref-17","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"对[[92-df-first-order-language]]中的任意集合签名 $L$ 和 $T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$、$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L$，[[92-df-first-order-derivation]]的有限演算满足"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-163","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-first-order-derivation]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-62","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-first-order-derivation]]"}],"outgoing":["b230b875687723ed"]}